Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test(motion): pin the Adaptive spiral round a part
 against main before #3818

Review of #3837: with Outside and a stock the Adaptive air plan runs its
own spiral round a part. The ring predicate keeps it off the ring law;
the new pin compares its moves with the digest read on b2ff0ef1b, and
goes red when the predicate is removed. The decision record now says
which Adaptive paths keep their links and which fall back to rings.

Refs #3822

